[PrintTextModified Text:あ、ああ、あ――！|#0102Adv27_AnAn006| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:ミリアは、あの時、<br>嘘をついたのか――！|#0102Adv27_AnAn007| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

